@startuml api-bet-snowflake
title POST /api/bet/snowflake — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:POST /api/bet/snowflake\nHeader **X-User-Access-Token** (raw JWT);

|SnowflakeIdController|
:requireAuthenticatedUser() via **RequiresFoundationUser**;
|UserFoundationGateway|
:GET **/api/user/me** (memo/cache by token);
|SnowflakeIdController|
:Inject **FoundationSnowflakeClient**;

|FoundationSnowflakeClient|
:Read **SF_SNOWFLAKE_ACCESS_KEY** via config;
if (access key empty?) then (yes)
  :throw **ConfigurationMissingException**;
  stop
endif
:Resolve API gateway base URL\n(**ResolvedApiGatewayBaseUrl**);
if (base URL missing?) then (yes)
  :throw **ConfigurationMissingException**;
  stop
endif
:POST {gateway}/api/snowflake/id\n(JSON body **access_key**; path overridable via **BET_FOUNDATION_SNOWFLAKE_MINT_PATH**);
if (HTTP not successful?) then (yes)
  :throw **DownstreamServiceException**;
  stop
endif
:Parse numeric **id** from response **data**;

|SnowflakeIdController|
:**logHandledApiRequest** (handler: bet.snowflake.mint, uid);
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**({ id });

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
